# Cloudflare Pages headers (plan Decision 8; landscape §2.6, §7).
# Origin-Agent-Cluster: ?1 keeps the document origin-keyed, which WebMCP requires;
# Permissions-Policy names the three features the app uses; no COOP/COEP, so no
# SharedArrayBuffer and no cross-origin isolation to break R2 fetches.
/*
  Origin-Agent-Cluster: ?1
  Permissions-Policy: tools=(self), microphone=(self), midi=(self)
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.wasm
  Content-Type: application/wasm
